   "said": "Ahmedabad regional office holiday list for the year 2026 • Holiday under Negotiable Instruments Act ■ Banks’ Closing of Accounts. January 14 Makar Sankranti/Magh Bihu • Holiday under Negotiable Instruments Act; 26 Republic Day • ...; March 4 Holi/Holi 2nd Day – Dhuleti/Yaosang 2nd Day/Dol Jatra; 21 Ramzan-Id (Id-Ul-Fitr) (Shawal-1)/Khutub-E-Ramzan/Sarhul; 26 Shree Ram Navami; 31 Mahavir Janmakalyanak/Mahavir Jayanti; April 1 To enable to Banks to close their yearly accounts; 3 Good Friday; 14 Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Jayanti/Maha Vishuva Sankranti/Biju/Buisu Festival/Tamil New Year's Day/Bohag Bihu/Cheiraoba/Baisakhi ... (and so for each office)"
