  {
   "url": "https://ddd.gov.in/document/holiday-list-2026/",
   "title": "U.T. Administration of Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu, Office of the Collector/Additional Director (GAD), Notification No. 11/01/96-06/GA/Holiday/III/2024-25/4046 of 22 December 2025, Part I: Public Holidays, 2026 (a scan, read as images)",
   "read": "2026-10-27",
   "said": "The UT Administration of Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu is pleased to declare the following days to be Public Holidays for the Government offices of Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu during the year 2026. 1. Makar Sankranti / Maghu Bihu/Pongal January 14; 2. Republic Day January 26; 3. Holi March 04; 4. Chaitra Sukladi/Gudi Padava/Ugadi/Cheti Chand March 19; 5. Id-ul-Fitr March 21; 6. Ram Navami March 26; 7. Mahavir Jayanti March 31; 8. Good Friday April 03; 9. Independence Day Parsi New Year’s day / Nauraj August 15; 10. Milad-un-Nabi or Id-e-Milad (Birthday of Prophet Mohammad) August 26; 11. Raksha Bandhan August 28; 12. Janmashtami September 04; 13. Ganesh Chaturthi / Vinayaka Chaturthi September 14; 14. Mahatma Gandhi’s Birthday October 02; 15. Dussehra (Vijay Dashmi) October 20; 16. Govardhan Puja November 09; 17. Christmas Day December 25. Note : The following days have not been notified as General Holidays as they fall on Sundays. 1. Maha Shivratri February 15 2. Diwali (Deepavali)/Naraka Chaturdasi November 08 3. Pratihas Shashthi or Surya Shashthi (Chhat Puja) November 15"
  },
  {
   "url": "https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s358238e9ae2dd305d79c2ebc8c1883422/uploads/2025/12/17665553348908.pdf",
   "title": "Lakshadweep Administration, General Administration & Protocol, Notification F.No.35/02/2018-Genl/864 of 17 December 2025, Annexure I: Closed Holidays for Lakshadweep Administration for the year 2026 (The Lakshadweep Gazette Extraordinary, Vol. LXI No. 42, page 35; a scan, read as an image)",
   "read": "2026-10-27",
   "said": "Closed Holidays for Lakshadweep Administration for the year 2026. 1. Pongal/ Makar Sankranti 14.01.2026 2. Republic Day 26.01.2026 3. Holi 04.03.2026 4. Id-ul-Fitr 21.03.2026 5. Ram Navami 26.03.2026 6. Mahavir Jayanti 31.03.2026 7. Budha Purnima 01.05.2026 8. Id-ul-Zuha (Bakrid) 27.05.2026 9. Muharram 26.06.2026 10. Independence Day/ Naoraz 15.08.2026 11. Onam/ Milad-un-Nabi or Id-e-Milad 26.08.2026 12. Janmashtami 04.09.2026 13. Ganesh Chaturthi/ Vinayak Chaturthi 14.09.2026 14. Gandhi Jayanti 02.10.2026 15. Dussehra (Vijay Dashmi) 20.10.2026 16. Guru Nanak’s Birthday 24.11.2026 17. Christmas Day 25.12.2026"
  },
  {
   "url": "https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s358238e9ae2dd305d79c2ebc8c1883422/uploads/2026/05/17798059673876.pdf",
   "title": "Lakshadweep Administration, Office Memorandum F.No.35/02/2018-Genl of 25 May 2026 (The Lakshadweep Gazette Extraordinary, Vol. LXII No. 12)",
   "read": "2026-10-27",
   "said": "it has been decided to shift the holiday on account of Id-ul-Zuha (Bakrid) to 28th May, 2026 (Thursday) in place of 27th May, 2026 (Wednesday) as notified earlier, for the Govt. Offices/ Institutions under this Administration, Banks and Court at Kavaratti Island."
  }
